    "body": "PR with the IETF-side changes is up for review/discussion: https://github.com/httpwg/http-extensions/pull/2783\r\n\r\nCurrently using `compression-dictionary` for the link relation even though it's a bit on the wordy side. In the case of HTTP, multiple responses referencing the same dictionary will compress away with HPACK/QPACK so it's not quite as bad as it may seem.",
